  "description": "A man burdened by heavy debt makes a desperate promise: if someone pays off everything he owes, he will do whatever is asked of him. That “someone” turns out to have a strong voyeuristic fixation. As a result, the man is forced to become a living proxy—an “avatar” who must sleep with various women on the other man’s behalf while the true client watches from the shadows.\n\nWhat begins as a simple transaction to erase his debt quickly drags him into a complicated and increasingly intimate web of control, desire, and blurred boundaries.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=5456&pid=webtoonguide), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/landing/episode/3213), [Mootoon](https://www.mootoon.co.kr/comic/moo_list.mg?tcode=0cja), MeToon",
